WEBVTT

00:05:27.082 --> 00:05:32.438
if they could see millions
or even billions of pieces of data.

00:05:32.462 --> 00:05:35.561
So they need a lot of data to do well,

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:38.037
the more data, the better it does,

00:05:38.061 --> 00:05:41.776
but you don't really have to teach it

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.212
specific rules and decision-making rules.

00:05:45.236 --> 00:05:47.171
CA: Right, it's able to use that data

00:05:47.195 --> 00:05:51.696
because someone put a caption of a cat
somewhere on a picture at one point,

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.171
so that it knows, basically,
cat or no cat.

00:05:54.195 --> 00:05:56.086
Is part of it then saying

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:59.648
well, any sphere
that you apply that power to

00:05:59.672 --> 00:06:04.065
can show this incredible pace
of outpacing us.